    "bottomLine": "The Myprotein powder to buy if you are in the US and want to order on Amazon.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 25 g (US listing)",
      "Calories": "About 110",
      "Third-party testing": "Informed Choice on UK tubs (check yours)",
      "Best for": "US buyers, lactose-sensitive"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HHL8HQ4G"
  },
  {
    "id": "myprotein-impact-whey-protein",
    "name": "Myprotein Impact Whey Protein",
    "brand": "Myprotein",
    "badge": "Best Value",
    "category": "Whey concentrate",
    "description": "The product that made Myprotein famous, with a 4.6-star average from more than 30,000 reviews on the brand's site. A 25 g scoop delivers roughly 20 to 22 g of protein depending on flavor and market, so plan on about 30 g of powder for 25 g of protein. It comes in dozens of flavors plus unflavored, and on sale it is often among the cheapest mainstream whey powders per gram of protein.",
    "pros": [
      "Frequently among the lowest cost per 25 g of protein on sale",
      "Huge flavor range, plus an unflavored option",
      "Creamier concentrate texture than an isolate"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Small scoop, about 20-22 g of protein per serving",
      "More lactose than an isolate",
      "Not sold by the brand on Amazon US when we checked"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The value pick if you tolerate lactose and buy direct during a sale.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 20-22 g per 25 g scoop",
      "Calories": "About 90-105",
      "Third-party testing": "Check certifier database",
      "Best for": "Tight budgets"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "myprotein-clear-whey-isolate",
    "name": "Myprotein Clear Whey Isolate",
    "brand": "Myprotein",
    "badge": "Best Clear Whey",
    "category": "Hydrolyzed whey isolate, clear drink",
    "description": "A juice-style protein drink made from hydrolyzed whey isolate. The US Amazon listing is a 35-serving, roughly 1.9 lb tub with about 20 g of protein per serving, in flavors such as Lemonade. In the UK, the Vimto flavor lists about 20 g of protein and around 89 calories per roughly 26 g serving, sweetened with sucralose. It is a good fit for people who find milky shakes heavy.",
    "pros": [
      "About 20 g of protein in a light, juice-like drink",
